{"id":"n72460-1-8","stage":2,"title":"한숨 · 叹气","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72460-1-8-1","ko":"왜 그렇게 땅이 꺼져라 한숨을 쉬니?","zh":"为什么叹气叹得这么厉害啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"땅이","meaning":"地面（땅이 꺼져라 한숨을 쉬다：夸张地说深深叹气）","explanation":"땅：地面（땅이 꺼져라 한숨을 쉬다：夸张地说深深叹气）；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"땅","audio":"/audio/f330041e9e005a6bf8b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30206","senseId":"1","lemma":"땅","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"땅이","audio":"/audio/6769a57b2910d067faa2.mp3"}},{"text":"꺼져라","meaning":"塌下来，塌陷","explanation":"꺼지다：塌下来，塌陷；어라：在 땅이 꺼져라 等固定表达中，以夸张方式描述动作的程度。","readings":[{"term":"꺼지다","audio":"/audio/553c838f462d024d140d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41592","senseId":"1","lemma":"꺼지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꺼져라","audio":"/audio/964232dcc2e26209ba93.mp3"}},{"text":"한숨을","meaning":"叹气","explanation":"한숨：叹气；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"한숨","audio":"/audio/3518247f7283983ba07d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72460","senseId":"1","lemma":"한숨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한숨을","audio":"/audio/0159590bcd3f76ad09fd.mp3"}},{"text":"쉬니?","meaning":"叹（气）（한숨을 쉬다）","explanation":"한숨을 쉬다 是叹气的搭配；쉬다 保留与呼吸有关的词典义，不是休息。-니 是非敬语疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62819","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쉬니","audio":"/audio/9c63d84dd3294b0e44b8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"f330041e9e005a6b","term":"땅","zh":"地面（땅이 꺼져라 한숨을 쉬다：夸张地说深深叹气）","audio":"/audio/f330041e9e005a6bf8b4.mp3","entryId":"30206","definition":"地面（땅이 꺼져라 한숨을 쉬다：夸张地说深深叹气）","pronunciation":["땅"]},{"id":"553c838f462d024d","term":"꺼지다","zh":"塌下来，塌陷","audio":"/audio/553c838f462d024d140d.mp3","entryId":"41592","definition":"地面等往下陷。","pronunciation":["꺼지다"]},{"id":"3518247f7283983b","term":"한숨","zh":"叹气","audio":"/audio/3518247f7283983ba07d.mp3","entryId":"72460","definition":"在忧愁或放松紧张的时候，呼出长气。","pronunciation":["한숨"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"呼吸、吐气","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"62819","definition":"呼吸、吐气","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4f23ce1c280641360120.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72460-1-8-2","ko":"요즘 걱정거리가 많아서 말이야.","zh":"最近有太多烦心事了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"걱정거리가","meaning":"愁事，心事","explanation":"걱정거리：愁事，心事；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"걱정거리","audio":"/audio/37eabcf9b0471073be34.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21608","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정거리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걱정거리가","audio":"/audio/ffc20472e5d676c74c6a.mp3